  "description": "Unleash vibrant street art energy, spooky Halloween fun, and oozing liquid drama with FAYEZ, a dripping display font! Designed with heavy black character silhouettes accented by oozing top drips, melting lower drop swashes, and a bold white outline frame, FAYEZ captures a fun graffiti and comic horror aesthetic. Perfect for Halloween event posters, graffiti apparel graphics, slime-themed product packaging, comic book titles, sticker designs, and edgy social media banners.",
